    "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (north/south/east/west). Movement can be blocked by walls, in which case position does not change but stamina is still spent. As you move, stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece\u2019s attributes: shape modifiers cycle the piece\u2019s shape, color modifiers cycle its color, and rotation modifiers rotate it 90\u00b0 clockwise. Goals can become \u201cactivated\u201d when your current piece matches their requirements; you must then step onto the goal cell to complete it. Stamina decreases with actions; if stamina reaches zero you lose a life, and losing all lives ends the game."
